    {
      "id": "arch0053",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 87,
      "y": 931,
      "width": 671,
      "height": 217,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0053",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7153,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8153,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792778197114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1. Require amount > 0 (schema also enforces > 0, max 2 decimals).\n2. Find the group and payer; require payer.group_id == group.id.\n3. Load group members in ascending ID order.\n4. Compute equal_share = amount / member_count, rounded half-up to cents.\n5. Insert Expense, then one ExpenseSplit per non-payer; commit.\n\nDomain exceptions are translated by the router to the existing HTTP errors.",
      "originalText": "1. Require amount > 0 (schema also enforces > 0, max 2 decimals).\n2. Find the group and payer; require payer.group_id == group.id.\n3. Load group members in ascending ID order.\n4. Compute equal_share = amount / member_count, rounded half-up to cents.\n5. Insert Expense, then one ExpenseSplit per non-payer; commit.\n\nDomain exceptions are translated by the router to the existing HTTP errors.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
