      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792778197120,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1. Ask balance service for net paise balances in this group.\n2. Put debtors and creditors in heaps; amount order selects largest\n   outstanding values; user ID gives deterministic tie ordering.\n3. Suggest min(debt, credit), reduce the remaining side, and repeat.\n4. Add member names and convert paise to rupees for response JSON.\n\nGreedy, O(n log n), at most n?1 transfers; not guaranteed globally\nminimal. Read-only: it does not record that anyone paid.",
      "originalText": "1. Ask balance service for net paise balances in this group.\n2. Put debtors and creditors in heaps; amount order selects largest\n   outstanding values; user ID gives deterministic tie ordering.\n3. Suggest min(debt, credit), reduce the remaining side, and repeat.\n4. Add member names and convert paise to rupees for response JSON.\n\nGreedy, O(n log n), at most n?1 transfers; not guaranteed globally\nminimal. Read-only: it does not record that anyone paid.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
